<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>The Great Wave — low poly after Hokusai</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Shippori+Mincho:wght@500;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #e9dcc0;
    --ink: #1d3a63;
    --ink-deep: #142a4d;
  }
  html, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; background: var(--paper); }
  body { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif; color: var(--ink); }
  #scene { position: fixed; inset: 0; display: block; }
  #grain {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 5;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply; opacity: .30;
    background-repeat: repeat; background-size: 320px 320px;
  }
  #vignette {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 4;
    background:
      radial-gradient(130% 100% at 46% 38%, rgba(255,250,232,0) 52%, rgba(126,101,61,.16) 100%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,248,230,.10), rgba(133,106,64,.07));
  }
  #cartouche {
    position: fixed; z-index: 6; top: clamp(18px, 4.2vh, 46px); left: clamp(18px, 3.4vw, 48px);
    display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 0 rgba(255,248,226,.35));
  }
  #cartouche .box {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl; text-orientation: upright;
    font-family: "Shippori Mincho", "Yu Mincho", serif;
    font-weight: 700; color: #223a5c;
    font-size: clamp(12px, 1.35vw, 19px); line-height: 1.18; letter-spacing: .1em;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(34,58,92,.85);
    padding: 10px 7px;
    background: rgba(238,226,197,.22);
  }
  #cartouche .side {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-family: "Shippori Mincho", serif; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(8px, .72vw, 11px); letter-spacing: .18em; color: #2a4060;
    opacity: .85; padding-top: 6px;
  }
  #caption {
    position: fixed; z-index: 6; left: clamp(18px, 3.4vw, 48px); bottom: clamp(16px, 3.4vh, 40px);
    max-width: min(440px, 74vw);
    text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(246,238,216,.6);
  }
  #caption .jp { font-family: "Shippori Mincho", serif; font-size: clamp(11px, 1vw, 14px); letter-spacing: .34em; color: #3a5374; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  #caption .en { font-size: clamp(17px, 1.75vw, 25px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; line-height: 1.05; color: #203a60; }
  #caption .sub { margin-top: 5px; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(11px, 1.02vw, 15px); color: #55627a; letter-spacing: .02em; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    #cartouche { top: 14px; left: 14px; }
    #caption { left: 14px; bottom: 14px; }
    #caption .en { font-size: 16px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<canvas id="scene" aria-label="Low poly animated reinterpretation of Hokusai's Great Wave off Kanagawa"></canvas>
<div id="vignette"></div>
